---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import HistoryTimeline from '../components/HistoryTimeline.svelte';
---

<BaseLayout title="History" description="Save points for your Deluge card — see what changed between sessions and put an old version back, entirely in your browser.">
  <section class="page-header">
    <h1 class="page-title">History</h1>
    <p class="page-desc">A memory for your card. Take a save point, then see exactly what changed between two of them — in words, not hex — and put an old version back.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="tool-area">
    <HistoryTimeline client:only="svelte" />
  </section>
  <section class="info">
    <div class="info-inner">
      <div class="info-block">
        <h3>What a save point holds</h3>
        <p>Every song, kit and synth patch on the card — the <code>.XML</code> files in <code>SONGS</code>, <code>KITS</code> and <code>SYNTHS</code>. <strong>Samples are never included</strong>: they are large, and they rarely change. A save point of a card you have barely touched costs almost nothing, because files that did not change are stored once and shared.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="info-block">
        <h3>What a diff shows</h3>
        <p>Tempo, key, swing, synth settings, and how many notes each clip gained or lost. Fields the Deluge rewrites whenever you save — scroll position, zoom, the pad preview — are still reported, but kept out of the way behind a count, so a save that only moved the view never looks like nothing happened.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="info-block">
        <h3>This is not a backup</h3>
        <p>Save points live in this browser, on this machine. Clear your site data and they are gone. Use <a href="/manage">Manage</a> to copy real files off the card, and export a save point to JSON if you want it somewhere safe. Restoring a file copies whatever is on the card into <code>HISTORY_BACKUP</code> first — nothing is destroyed.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .page-title {
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .page-desc {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .tool-area {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem 3rem;
  }

  .info {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
  }
  .info-inner {
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }
  .info-block h3 {
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
  .info-block p {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
</style>
